## Root Cause Chain

Tool 2 output -> AI reformatted wrong -> Tool 3 empty -> Skeleton POM
-> No metadata passed -> Tool 4-6 skeletons -> Reviewer approved skeletons

## Why DDs Failed

1. DDs are passive - AI doesn't re-read after each tool
2. Skill describes but doesn't enforce checkpoints
3. No STOP AND VERIFY

## Solution: Enhanced Skill with Enforcement

```
Step N: Call Tool
  CHECKPOINT: Verify output fields
  STORE: variable = output
  MUST_PASS: variable to next tool
  IF FAIL: STOP
```

